docs {
  # PUT /api/children/{childId}/prep-questions/order

  Sets the display order of the child's questions. Body is `ReorderParentPrepQuestionsRequest`.

  ## Body

  - `ids` — question ids in the wanted order; each must belong to this child. Questions not listed
    keep their relative order and follow the listed ones.

  ## Responses

  - `200` — `data: ParentPrepQuestionDto[]`, the whole list in its new order
  - `400` — `ids` empty, repeated, or containing an id that is not one of this child's questions
  - `401` — missing/invalid bearer token
  - `404` — child not found or the caller has no access to it
}
